# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Setup 1 and 2 (v0.3): Sync off on a running clock (the Swell back on
# its own Rate), on again; Tune at 432 Hz, then 0.1 Hz steps with SEL; its pages' screens. Rendered by this branch and
# by main (a new script: listed, then compared from the next PR on). Not a test of its own (no expectations).
pressure w0 0
pressure w1 0
pressure w2 0
pressure w3 0
pressure w4 0
pressure w5 0
pressure w6 0
pressure w7 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap GLO
wait 300
clock 120 1
wait 3000
wav setup.wav
wait 4000
shot setup1.png
spin K4 1
wait 6000
spin K4 1
wait 4000
tap GLO
wait 300
spin K2 -8
wait 3000
press SEL
spin K2 3
release SEL
wait 3000
shot setup2.png
clock 0
wait 2000
wavstop
